cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MOKG-HGNN: code and supplementary material"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/johndef64/MOKG-HGNN"
abstract: >-
  MOKG-HGNN is a multi-scale heterogeneous graph neural network for pan-cancer
  molecular subtyping. Each tumour is represented as a heterogeneous graph in
  which gene, miRNA and transcription-factor nodes carrying the TCGA Pan-Cancer
  omics are linked upward to pathway, Gene Ontology and disease nodes taken from
  the PheKnowLator biomedical knowledge graph, so that message passing traverses
  several levels of biological organisation rather than the molecular layer
  alone. Subtyping is cast as graph classification over the 27-class integrated
  iCluster taxonomy.
